      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>quick question: when Miss Information flips at the start of the villain turn, after that does she immediately destroy a clue card, or does she do that on the start of the next turn?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know the &#39;start&#39; of the turn does not conclude until all cards that say &#39;start of the villain turn&#39; are completed but does the particular action of Miss Information destroying a clue card happen right away? it seems it would be &#39;better&#39; for her if it did not do so immediately, depending on the Clues in play.</p>",
